MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8b80b44c40c687e44a07621c361d39ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: LightHouse 3-3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (The way you follow the these lighthouses...)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (...does not seem to be much of a different on how you lived your life.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Always hop from one lead to another despite how absurd or meaningless
      they may seem.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Just like how absurd it is to have a light house in a farm field.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (People who are lost often try their best to grasp on to any thread just
      to move forward.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Such there is a comfort in getting led by a string.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (And to find the strength to move on your own, it's a path of unbearable
      suffering.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Beside the switch you spy a parchment with crudely drawn lines and symbols.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (It is a map.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: (You decided to take it with you. It should aid you well in this journey.)
  - name: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '(You got a [Farm Field Map].)

      <i>Press M to open the map.</i>'
